m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"ngi-explore-card\">\n        <div class=\"ngi-explore-card-top\"><span class=\"ngi-card-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1\"/></svg></span><span class=\"ngi-card-label\">Guiding Principles</span></div>\n        <h3>Our Mission</h3><p>To empower youth through education, awareness, leadership development, critical thinking, community engagement, and collaborative action.</p>\n        <a class=\"ngi-card-link\" href=\"__NGI_SITE_URL__?page=vision-mission\">Vision &amp; Mission <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"ngi-explore-card\">\n        <div class=\"ngi-explore-card-top\"><span class=\"ngi-card-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m3 10 5-5 4 3 4-3 5 5-7 7a3 3 0 0 1-4 0l-7-7Zm6 0 3 3 3-3\"/></svg></span><span class=\"ngi-card-label\">About NGI</span></div>\n        <h3>How We Work</h3><p>NGI works in collaboration with non-governmental organizations (NGOs) legally registered with the relevant authorities in Pakistan to implement flagship programmes and partnership-based projects.</p>\n        <a class=\"ngi-card-link\" href=\"__NGI_SITE_URL__?page=about\">About NGI <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"ngi-explore-footer\" hidden><span class=\"ngi-scroll-count\" aria-hidden=\"true\">01 / 03</span><div class=\"ngi-scroll-indicators\" role=\"gro",
    "up\" aria-label=\"Choose card position\"></div></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"support-section\">\n<div class=\"support-grid\">\n\n<!-- SUPPORT OUR CAUSE & TRANSPARENCY SECTION -->\n<div class=\"support-copy\">\n<div class=\"support-inner\">\n<span class=\"eyebrow\"> Support Our Mission</span>\n<h3>Empower Communities With Complete Transparency</h3>\n<p>Your generous contributions fuel our noble initiatives and grassroots programs. We are deeply committed to absolute financial transparency—ensuring every single contribution is carefully managed, strictly accounted for, and directed efficiently toward creating meaningful social impact across rural and urban communities.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- APPLY NOW FOR UFAQ PROJECT SECTION -->\n<div id=\"formCard\" class=\"apply-panel\">\n<span class=\"eyebrow\"> Youth Led Partnership Programme by Amarta Peace Foundation</span>\n<h3>Apply for UFAQ Volunteer Programme</h3>\n<p>UFAQ is a flagship programme of Amarta Peace Foundation, implemented in partnership with NGI (Next Generation Initiative), an independent, student-led youth initiative.</p>\n<a href=\"__NGI_SITE_URL__?page=ufaq\" class=\"ufaq-apply-btn\">Apply Now For UFAQ</a>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</main>\n<div class=\"site-footer\">\n<div class=\"footer-inner\">\n<div class=\"footer-grid\">\n<div>\n<h3>NGI - Next Generation Initiative</h3>\n<p>Empowering youth and fostering positive social transformation across Sindh &amp; Pakistan.</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h4>Contact Information</h4>\n<p><strong>Phone / WhatsApp:</strong> +923043003600</p>\n<p><strong>Email:</strong> ngiactivities@outlook.com</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h4>Connect With Us</h4>\n<div>\n<a href=\"https://facebook.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"footer-link\">\n<svg style=\"width:15px;height:15px;fill:currentColor\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M24 12.073c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12s-12 5.373-12 12c0 5.99 4.388 10.954 10.125 11.854v-8.385H7.078v-3.47h3.047V9.43c0-