\" target=\"_self\">Skip to content</a>\n\n<header class=\"site-header\"><div class=\"brand-block\">\n<div class=\"w brand-container\">\n<div class=\"brand-row\">\n<div class=\"brand-logo\">\n<img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1S5-QYFSCaPwLxHTXR51VhfiXbAkokHvd\" alt=\"NGI Logo\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none';this.parentNode.innerHTML='NGI'\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"brand-text\">\n<div class=\"brand-title\">NEXT GENERATION<br>INITIATIVE (NGI)</div>\n<div class=\"brand-tagline\">Empowering Youth. Transforming Communities.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n<nav aria-label=\"Main navigation\" class=\"main-nav\"><div class=\"nav-inner\"><button class=\"menu-toggle\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"nav-links\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">☰</span> Menu</button><div id=\"nav-links\" class=\"nav-links\"><a href=\"__NGI_SITE_URL__?page=home\">Home</a><a href=\"__NGI_SITE_URL__?page=about\">About NGI</a><a href=\"__NGI_SITE_URL__?page=vision-mission\">Vision &amp; Mission</a><a href=\"__NGI_SITE_URL__?page=leadership\">Leadership</a><a href=\"__NGI_SITE_URL__?page=membership\" aria-current=\"page\">NGI Membership</a><a href=\"__NGI_SITE_URL__?page=ufaq\">UFAQ Volunteer Application</a></div></div></nav>\n</header>\n<main id=\"main\"><div class=\"page-hero\"><div class=\"page-wrap youth-feature\"><div>\n  <span class=\"eyebrow\">Join NGI</span>\n  <h1>NGI Membership</h1>\n  <p>Become a part of Next Generation Initiative and contribute to youth empowerment and community development.</p></div><img class=\"youth-feature-photo\" src=\"__NGI_ASSET_0__\" alt=\"School students working together on classroom art activitie",
    "s\" width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" style=\"height:auto;max-height:none;aspect-ratio:1280/853;object-fit:contain;object-position:center\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\">\n</div></div>\n<section class=\"membership-section page-wrap\" aria-labelledby=\"membership-title\">\n  <div class=\"membership-intro\">\n    <span class=\"eyebrow\">Membership Portal</span>\n    <h2 id=\"membership-title\">Membership Application Form</h2>\n    <p>Apply to become a member of NGI. This is an independent NGI membership application, not the UFAQ volunteer application.</p>\n    <div style=\"margin-top:18px;border-left:4px solid var(--blue);background:var(--tint);padding:18px 20px\"><h3 style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">About NGI and How We Work</h3><p>Next Generation Initiative (NGI) is an independent, student-led youth initiative. NGI works in collaboration with non-governmental organizations (NGOs) legally registered with the relevant authorities in Pakistan to implement flagship programmes and partnership-based projects. Through these collaborations, NGI mobilizes young people and supports community-led initiatives in education, awareness, leadership development and social transformation. NGI operates independently as a youth-led initiative; these partnerships do not imply that NGI itself is a registered NGO.</p></div>\n    <p class=\"membership-required\">Fields marked with an asterisk (*) are required.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div id=\"membership-status\" class=\"membership-status\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\">Membership registration is not yet connected. You can review the form, but submissions are not available.</div>\n  <form id=\"membership-form\" method=\"post\">\n    <fieldset><legend>01. Personal information</legend>\n      <div class=\"membership-grid\">\n        <div><label for=\"full-name\">Full Name *</label><input id=\"full-name\" name=\"fullName\" autocomplete=\"name\" maxlength=\"100\" required></div>\n        <div><label for=\"email\">Email Address *</label><input id=\"email\" name=\"email\" type=\"email\" autocomplete=\"email\" maxlength=\"150\" required></div>\n        <div><label for=\"phone\">WhatsApp / Phone Number *</label><input id=\"phone\" name=\"phone\" type=\"tel\" autocomplete=\"tel\" maxlength=\"20\" placeholder=\"03001234567\" required></div>\n        <div><label for=\"district\">District *</label><select id=\"district\" name=\"district\" required><option value=\"\">Select district</option><option>Badin</option><option>Dadu</option><option>Ghotki</option><option>Hyderabad</option><option>Jacobabad</option><option>Jamshoro</option><option>Kambar Shahdadkot</option><option>Karachi</option><option>Kashmore</option><option>Khairpur</option><option>Larkana</option><option>Matiari</option><option>Mirpurkhas</option><option>Naushahro Feroze</option><option>Sanghar</option><option>Shaheed Benazirabad</option><option>Shikarpur</option><option>Sujawal</option><option>Sukkur</option><option>Tando Allahyar</option><option>Tando Muhammad Khan</option><option>Tharparkar</option><option>Thatta</option><option>Umerkot</option><option>Other</option></select></div>\n        <div><label for=\"city\">City / Town *</label><input id=\"city\" name=\"city\" autocomplete=\"address-level2\" maxlength=\"80\" required></div>\n        <div><label for=\"education\">Education Level *</label><select id=\"education\" name=\"education\" required><option value=\"\">Select level</option><option>Matric</option><option>Intermediate</option><option>Undergraduate / Bachelor's</option><option>Graduate / Master's</option><option>Other</option></select></div>\n      </div>\n      <d",
    "iv class=\"membership-row\"><label for=\"institution\">Institution / Occupation</label><input id=\"institution\" name=\"institution\" maxlength=\"150\"></div>\n    </fieldset>\n    <fieldset><legend>02. Your interests</legend>\n      <div class=\"membership-grid\">\n        <div><label for=\"interest\">Area of Interest *</label><select id=\"interest\" name=\"interest\" required><option value=\"\">Choose an area</option><option>Education</option><option>Youth Leadership</option><option>Community Development</option><option>Social Awareness</option><option>Media and Communications</option><option>Research and Documentation</option><option>Event Management</option><option>General Membership</option></select></div>\n        <div><label for=\"availability\">Availability</label><input id=\"availability\" name=\"availability\" maxlength=\"60\" placeholder=\"e.g. 5 hours per week\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"membership-row\"><label for=\"reason\">Why do you want to join NGI? *</label><textarea id=\"reason\" name=\"reason\" rows=\"4\" maxlength=\"1200\" required></textarea></div>\n    </fieldset>\n    <fieldset><legend>03. Consent and declaration</legend>\n      <p>NGI will use the information you provide to review your membership application and contact you about membership.</p>\n      <label class=\"membership-check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"consent\" required> <span>I consent to NGI using my information for these membership purposes. *</span></label>\n      <label class=\"membership-check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"accuracy\" required> <span>I confirm that the information I have provided is accurate. *</span></label>\n    </fieldset>\n    <div class=\"membership-hp\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><label for=\"website\">Website</label><input id=\"website\" name=\"website\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div>\n    <fieldset><legend>04. Verify your email</legend>\n      <p>Request a code and enter it within 10 minutes. Use the same browser tab to submit your application.</p>\n      <button id=\"membership-send-code\" type=\"button\" disabled>Send Email Code</button>\n      <div class=\"membership-row\"><label for=\"membership-code\">Email Verification Code *</label><input id=\"membership-code\" name=\"code\" autocomplete=\"one-time-code\" maxlength=\"12\" pattern=\"[A-Fa-f0-9]{12}\" required></div>\n    </fieldset>\n    <button id=\"membership-submit\" type=\"submit\" disabled>Submit Membership Application</button>\n  </form>\n  <dialog id=\"membership-success-dialog\" class=\"membership-success-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"membership-success-title\" aria-describedby=\"membership-success-description\">\n    <div class=\"membership-success-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m5 12 4 4L19 6\"/></svg></div>\n    <span class=\"eyebrow\">NGI Membership</span>\n    <h2 id=\"membership-success-title\">Successfully Received</h2>\n    <p id=\"membership-success-description\">Thank you for submitting your membership application. The relevant NGI team will review your application and contact you regarding the next steps.</p>\n    <div class=\"membership-success-reference\"><span>Application Reference Number</span><strong id=\"membership-success-reference\"></strong></div>\n    <button type=\"button\" id=\"membership-success-close\">Close</button>\n  </dialog>\n</section>\n<script>\nwindow.NGI_MEMBERSHIP_ENDPOINT = \"__NGI_SITE_URL__\";\n</script>\n<script>\n(function () {\n  \"use strict\";\n  const form = document.getElementById(\"membership-form\");\n  const butt",
    "on = document.getElementById(\"membership-submit\");\n  const sendButton = document.getElementById(\"membership-send-code\");\n  const email = document.getElementById(\"email\");\n  const code = document.getElementById(\"membership-code\");\n  let challenge = \"\";\n  let verifiedAddress = \"\";\n  const status = document.getElementById(\"membership-status\");\n  const dialog = document.getElementById(\"membership-success-dialog\");\n  const referenceText = document.getElementById(\"membership-success-reference\");\n  const closeButton = document.getElementById(\"membership-success-close\");\n  if (dialog && closeButton) {\n    closeButton.addEventListener(\"click\", function () {\n      if (typeof dialog.close === \"function\") dialog.close();\n      else dialog.removeAttribute(\"open\");\n    });\n    dialog.addEventListener(\"close\", function () { button.focus({preventScroll: true}); });\n  }\n  function showSuccessPopup(reference) {\n    if (!dialog || !referenceText || !closeButton) {\n      status.scrollIntoView({behavior: \"smooth\", block: \"center\"});\n      return;\n    }\n    referenceText.textContent = reference || \"Not available\";\n    try {\n      if (typeof dialog.showModal === \"function\") {\n        if (!dialog.open) dialog.showModal();\n      } else {\n        dialog.setAttribute(\"open\", \"\");\n      }\n      closeButton.focus({preventScroll: true});\n    } catch (_) {\n      status.scrollIntoView({behavior: \"smooth\", block: \"center\"});\n    }\n  }\n  const endpoint = String(window.NGI_MEMBERSHIP_ENDPOINT || \"\").trim();\n  const connected = /^https:\\/\\/script\\.google\\.com\\/macros\\/s\\/[A-Za-z0-9_-]+\\/exec$/.test(endpoint);\n  function message(text, kind) {\n    status.textContent = text;\n    status.dataset.kind = kind || \"info\";\n  }\n  async function request(data) {\n    const response = await ngiWebsiteFetch(endpoint, {\n      method: \"POST\", headers: {\"Content-Type\": \"text/plain;charset=utf-8\"},\n      credentials: \"omit\", redirect: \"follow\", body: JSON.stringify(data)\n    });\n    const result = await response.json();\n    if (!response.ok || !result.success) throw new Error(result.message || \"Request could not be confirmed.\");\n    return result;\n  }\n  function resetChallenge() {\n    challenge = \"\";\n    verifiedAddress = \"\";\n    code.value = \"\";\n    button.disabled = true;\n  }\n  email.addEventListener(\"input\", resetChallenge);\n  sendButton.disabled = !connected;\n  sendButton.addEventListener(\"click\", async function () {\n    if (!connected || !email.reportValidity()) return;\n    const address = email.value.trim().toLowerCase();\n    sendButton.disabled = true;\n    message(\"Sending verification code…\");\n    try {\n      const result = await request({action: \"sendCode\", email: address, website: form.elements.website.value});\n      if (!result.codeSent || typeof result.challenge !== \"string\") throw new Error(\"Code delivery could not be confirmed.\");\n      if (email.value.trim().toLowerCase() !== address) {\n        message(\"Email address changed. Request a code for the current address.\", \"error\");\n        return;\n      }\n      challenge = result.challenge;\n      verifiedAddress = address;\n      code.value = \"\";\n      button.disabled = false;\n      message(\"Verification code sent. Check your email and enter the code.\");\n      code.focus();\n    } catch (error) {\n      message(error.message || \"Unable to send a verification code.\", \"error\");\n    } finally {\n      sendButton.disabled = false;\n    }\n  });\n  if (connected) message(\"Please complete the form to apply for NGI membership.\");\n  form.addEvent",
    "Listener(\"submit\", async function (event) {\n    event.preventDefault();\n    if (!connected || button.disabled || !challenge || email.value.trim().toLowerCase() !== verifiedAddress || !form.reportValidity()) return;\n    const data = Object.fromEntries(new FormData(form).entries());\n    let phone = String(data.phone || \"\").replace(/[\\s()-]/g, \"\");\n    if (!/^(?:\\+92|92|0)3\\d{9}$/.test(phone)) {\n      message(\"Please enter a valid Pakistani mobile number.\", \"error\");\n      document.getElementById(\"phone\").focus();\n      return;\n    }\n    data.action = \"apply\";\n    data.challenge = challenge;\n    data.phone = phone.replace(/^\\+?92/, \"0\");\n    button.disabled = true;\n    sendButton.disabled = true;\n    button.textContent = \"Submitting…\";\n    message(\"Submitting your membership application…\");\n    try {\n      const result = await request(data);\n      form.reset();\n      resetChallenge();\n      const reference = typeof result.reference === \"string\" ? result.reference.trim() : \"\";\n      message(\"Membership application received. Your reference number is \" + (reference || \"not available\") + \".\", \"success\");\n      showSuccessPopup(reference);\n    } catch (error) {\n      message(\"Your submission could not be confirmed. Please try again or contact NGI. \" + (error.message || \"\"), \"error\");\n    } finally {\n      button.disabled = !challenge;\n      sendButton.disabled = false;\n      button.textContent = \"Submit Membership Application\";\n    }\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n</main>\n<div class=\"site-footer\">\n<div class=\"footer-inner\">\n<div class=\"footer-grid\">\n<div>\n<h3>NGI - Next Generation Initiative</h3>\n<p>Empowering youth and fostering positive social transformation across Sindh &amp; Pakistan.</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h4>Contact Information</h4>\n<p><strong>Phone / WhatsApp:</strong> +923043003600</p>\n<p><strong>Email:</strong> ngiactivities@outlook.com</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h4>Connect With Us</h4>\n<div>\n<a href=\"https://facebook.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"footer-link\">\n<svg style=\"width:15px;height:15px;fill:currentColor\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M24 12.073c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12s-12 5.373-12 12c0 5.99 4.388 10.954 10.125 11.854v-8.385H7.078v-3.47h3.047V9.43c0-3.007 1.792-4.669 4.533-4.669 1.312 0 2.686.235 2.686.235v2.953H15.83c-1.491 0-1.956.925-1.956 1.874v2.25h3.328l-.532 3.47h-2.796v8.385C19.612 23.027 24 18.062 24 12.073z\"></path></svg>\nFacebook\n</a>\n<a href=\"mailto:ngiactivities@outlook.com\" class=\"footer-link\">\n<svg style=\"width:15px;height:15px;fill:currentColor\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M24 5.457v13.909c0 .904-.732 1.636-1.636 1.636h-3.819V11.73l-6.545 4.364-6.545-4.364v9.273H1.636C.732 21.002 0 20.27 0 19.366V5.457c0-1.011.821-1.832 1.832-1.832h.545L12 9.818l9.623-6.193h.545c1.011 0 1.832.821 1.832 1.832z\"></path></svg>\nEmail Us\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"copyright\">\n© 2026 NGI - Next Generation Initiative. All rights reserved.\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){const b=document.querySelector('.menu-toggle');const n=document.getElementById('nav-links');b.addEventListener('click',()=>{const open=b.getAttribute('aria-expanded')==='true';b.setAttribute('aria-expanded',String(!open));n.classList.toggle('open',!open)});n.addEventListener('click',e=>{if(e.target.closest('a')){b.setAttribute('aria-expanded','false');n.classList.remove('open')}})})();\n</script>__NGI_SECTION_SCRIPT__</body></html>"
